// Associative insurance data model — Qlik Sense Data Architect (QSDA 2024)
// Goal: Build a clean, synthetic-key-free model for policy/claims/distributor data.
// Concepts: Associative model, Synthetic keys, Circular references, Star schema / link table, Key naming
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

